repreneurship is just being  consistent not giving up because you  have roadblocks and also not giving in  because other people tell you that  you're nuts you are nuts and you should  be proud of it stick with what you  believe in  so those are my seven best motivational  quotes to start the day with I'm curious  what you guys thought of it which one  did you like the best what resonated the  most with you leave it in the comments  below and I'll join in the discussion  also there are quotes that you really  enjoy that you want to add to the list  you want to put an 8 9 10 on that list  leave in the comments I'm really curious  to see what motivates inspires you guys  finally I want to give a quick shout out  to Damian Calzado from surf bounce calm  didn't even thank you so much for buying  my book really means a lot to me those  are you watching if you want to change  that a shout-out in a future video make  sure to pick up a copy of the book and  email in your receipt so we can keep  track thank you guys so much for  watching  continue to believe and I'll see you  soon
 

